[
  {
    "RowId": 44694,
    "Text": "For my next feat, let's turn up the heat!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44695,
    "Text": "You've no recourse but to cower before my <i>true</i> power!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44696,
    "Text": "Before we're through, you'll learn there's nothing I can't do!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44697,
    "Text": "Refuse to obey and I'll make you pay!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44698,
    "Text": "No matter where you run, I'll still have my fun!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44699,
    "Text": "My patience is through─and now so are you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44700,
    "Text": "My patience is through─and now so are you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44701,
    "Text": "I shall snuff your flame out─another swift rout!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44702,
    "Text": "Ohoho! You catch on fast!\nJust like a pupil from my past!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44703,
    "Text": "Ohoho! Too slow, fear!\nYou never stood a chance, my dear!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44704,
    "Text": "You've proven a match for my magicked doll... Perhaps you have merit, after all."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44705,
    "Text": "Have care! There's no telling what she'll conjure next."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44706,
    "Text": "Dammit! Is everyone all right?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44707,
    "Text": "A comrade is down, but we mustn't give up! Quickly─someone revive them!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44708,
    "Text": "I fear we'll not survive this without powerful healing magicks."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44709,
    "Text": "Ohohoho!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44710,
    "Text": "Who... Who calleth my name...?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44711,
    "Text": "We stand now before the very father of creation... Hold nothing back."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44712,
    "Text": "Yearn... Desire... Hunger...for the end of mortality."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44713,
    "Text": "Desire...for the Emptiness..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44714,
    "Text": "A fate...decided..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44715,
    "Text": "O darkness..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44716,
    "Text": "Bear unto them...my essence..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44717,
    "Text": "O star...descend from the heavens...I beseech thee..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44718,
    "Text": "O Altana, I beg your grace once more."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44719,
    "Text": "Thine arrogant heart shall be mine..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44720,
    "Text": "This place is... It's been swallowed by the Emptiness, the darkness of man's heart made manifest."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44721,
    "Text": "So long as I hold faith in my comrades, and they in me, darkness shall find no purchase in my heart."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44722,
    "Text": "The reign of Twilight is inevitable..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44723,
    "Text": "Thine own weakness betrays thee..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44724,
    "Text": "It's taking the darkness into itself!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44725,
    "Text": "Our farewell shall be...forever."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44726,
    "Text": "The Twilight God could never... What has Sareel Ja done?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44727,
    "Text": "What in the world?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44728,
    "Text": "The Emptiness threatens to spread."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44729,
    "Text": "Careful, lest the darkness take you."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44730,
    "Text": "A perfect death...denied...\nThe vessel...must needs...be filled..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44731,
    "Text": "He means to use the darkness in my heart against us!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44732,
    "Text": "What are you plotting, witch!?"
  },
