  {
    "RowId": 45300,
    "Text": "All who dare oppose me shall quake before the silken Dark..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45301,
    "Text": "Perish."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45302,
    "Text": "The void's power is mine to wield."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45303,
    "Text": "You have no place here."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45304,
    "Text": "Accept your downfall."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45305,
    "Text": "Struggle is futile."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45306,
    "Text": "And thus did all boundaries cease to be."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45307,
    "Text": "Be still."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45308,
    "Text": "Doth the yawning rift not tempt you?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45309,
    "Text": "Behold the truth of this world!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45310,
    "Text": "The void consumes..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45311,
    "Text": "Naught will endure..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45312,
    "Text": "Neither past nor future..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45313,
    "Text": "Only one certainty remains..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45314,
    "Text": "My triumph!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45315,
    "Text": "I've breached the darkness! Let the Light guide you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45316,
    "Text": "You must break free!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45317,
    "Text": "The underlings are no more. Now to deal with Enuo!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45318,
    "Text": "Life and death rendered meaningless..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45319,
    "Text": "Such is the power of the void!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45320,
    "Text": "I will not yield my domain!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45321,
    "Text": "Light protect us!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45322,
    "Text": "The void shall never cease to be!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45323,
    "Text": "My power is absolute!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45324,
    "Text": "Embrace the emptiness beyond Light and Dark."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45325,
    "Text": "Succumb to eternal silence!"
  },
